Subject: [PATCH] resolve attack targets by stored GUID without breaking actions

Retain the Unit* AttackAction interface used by specialized playerbot actions,
while resolving cached Unit values by their captured GUID before returning them.
The current, duel, and raid-icon attack paths continue to pass GUIDs directly.

